{"parents": [], "prev": {"link": "../bound-methods/ActiveSession.terminate/", "title": "ActiveSession.terminate()"}, "next": {"link": "ChatAction/", "title": "ChatAction"}, "title": "Enumerations", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"enumerations\">\n<h1>Enumerations<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#enumerations\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>This page is about Pyrogram enumerations.\nEnumerations are types that hold a group of related values to be used whenever a constant value is required.\nThey will help you deal with those values in a type-safe way and also enable code completion so that you can be sure\nto apply only a valid value among the expected ones.</p>\n<hr class=\"docutils\" />\n<div class=\"table-wrapper autosummary longtable docutils container\">\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"ChatAction/#pyrogram.enums.ChatAction\" title=\"pyrogram.enums.ChatAction\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ChatAction</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Chat action enumeration used in <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/ChatEvent/#pyrogram.types.ChatEvent\" title=\"pyrogram.types.ChatEvent\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ChatEvent</span></code></a>.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"ChatEventAction/#pyrogram.enums.ChatEventAction\" title=\"pyrogram.enums.ChatEventAction\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ChatEventAction</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Chat event action enumeration used in <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../methods/get_chat_event_log/#pyrogram.Client.get_chat_event_log\" title=\"pyrogram.Client.get_chat_event_log\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">get_chat_event_log()</span></code></a>.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"ChatMemberStatus/#pyrogram.enums.ChatMemberStatus\" title=\"pyrogram.enums.ChatMemberStatus\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ChatMemberStatus</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Chat member status enumeration used in <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/ChatMember/#pyrogram.types.ChatMember\" title=\"pyrogram.types.ChatMember\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ChatMember</span></code></a>.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"ChatMembersFilter/#pyrogram.enums.ChatMembersFilter\" title=\"pyrogram.enums.ChatMembersFilter\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ChatMembersFilter</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Chat members filter enumeration used in <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../methods/get_chat_members/#pyrogram.Client.get_chat_members\" title=\"pyrogram.Client.get_chat_members\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">get_chat_members()</span></code></a></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"ChatType/#pyrogram.enums.ChatType\" title=\"pyrogram.enums.ChatType\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ChatType</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Chat type enumeration used in <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/Chat/#pyrogram.types.Chat\" title=\"pyrogram.types.Chat\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Chat</span></code></a>.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"ChatJoinType/#pyrogram.enums.ChatJoinType\" title=\"pyrogram.enums.ChatJoinType\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ChatJoinType</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>How the service message <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"MessageServiceType/#pyrogram.enums.MessageServiceType.NEW_CHAT_MEMBERS\" title=\"pyrogram.enums.MessageServiceType.NEW_CHAT_MEMBERS\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">NEW_CHAT_MEMBERS</span></code></a> was used for the member to join the chat.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"ClientPlatform/#pyrogram.enums.ClientPlatform\" title=\"pyrogram.enums.ClientPlatform\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ClientPlatform</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Valid platforms for a <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../client/#pyrogram.Client\" title=\"pyrogram.Client\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Client</span></code></a>.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"MessageEntityType/#pyrogram.enums.MessageEntityType\" title=\"pyrogram.enums.MessageEntityType\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MessageEntityType</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Message entity type enumeration used in <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/MessageEntity/#pyrogram.types.MessageEntity\" title=\"pyrogram.types.MessageEntity\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MessageEntity</span></code></a>.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"MessageMediaType/#pyrogram.enums.MessageMediaType\" title=\"pyrogram.enums.MessageMediaType\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MessageMediaType</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Message media type enumeration used in <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/Message/#pyrogram.types.Message\" title=\"pyrogram.types.Message\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Message</span></code></a>.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"MessageOriginType/#pyrogram.enums.MessageOriginType\" title=\"pyrogram.enums.MessageOriginType\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MessageOriginType</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Message origin type enumeration used in <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/MessageOrigin/#pyrogram.types.MessageOrigin\" title=\"pyrogram.types.MessageOrigin\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MessageOrigin</span></code></a>.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"MessageServiceType/#pyrogram.enums.MessageServiceType\" title=\"pyrogram.enums.MessageServiceType\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MessageServiceType</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Message service type enumeration used in <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/Message/#pyrogram.types.Message\" title=\"pyrogram.types.Message\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Message</span></code></a>.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"MessagesFilter/#pyrogram.enums.MessagesFilter\" title=\"pyrogram.enums.MessagesFilter\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MessagesFilter</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Messages filter enumeration used in <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../methods/search_messages/#pyrogram.Client.search_messages\" title=\"pyrogram.Client.search_messages\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">search_messages()</span></code></a> and <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../methods/search_global/#pyrogram.Client.search_global\" title=\"pyrogram.Client.search_global\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">search_global()</span></code></a></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"ParseMode/#pyrogram.enums.ParseMode\" title=\"pyrogram.enums.ParseMode\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ParseMode</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Parse mode enumeration used in various places to set a specific parse mode</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"PollType/#pyrogram.enums.PollType\" title=\"pyrogram.enums.PollType\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PollType</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Poll type enumeration used in <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/Poll/#pyrogram.types.Poll\" title=\"pyrogram.types.Poll\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Poll</span></code></a>.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"ProfileColor/#pyrogram.enums.ProfileColor\" title=\"pyrogram.enums.ProfileColor\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ProfileColor</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Profile color enumeration used in <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/ChatColor/#pyrogram.types.ChatColor\" title=\"pyrogram.types.ChatColor\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ChatColor</span></code></a>.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"AccentColor/#pyrogram.enums.AccentColor\" title=\"pyrogram.enums.AccentColor\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AccentColor</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Accent color enumeration used in <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/ChatColor/#pyrogram.types.ChatColor\" title=\"pyrogram.types.ChatColor\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ChatColor</span></code></a>.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"SentCodeType/#pyrogram.enums.SentCodeType\" title=\"pyrogram.enums.SentCodeType\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">SentCodeType</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Sent code type enumeration used in <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/SentCode/#pyrogram.types.SentCode\" title=\"pyrogram.types.SentCode\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">SentCode</span></code></a>.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"NextCodeType/#pyrogram.enums.NextCodeType\" title=\"pyrogram.enums.NextCodeType\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">NextCodeType</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Next code type enumeration used in <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/SentCode/#pyrogram.types.SentCode\" title=\"pyrogram.types.SentCode\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">SentCode</span></code></a>.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"UserStatus/#pyrogram.enums.UserStatus\" title=\"pyrogram.enums.UserStatus\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">UserStatus</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>User status enumeration used in <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../types/User/#pyrogram.types.User\" title=\"pyrogram.types.User\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">User</span></code></a>.</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"toctree-wrapper compound\">\n</div>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["api/enums/ChatAction", "ChatAction", "N", "next"], ["api/bound-methods/ActiveSession.terminate", "ActiveSession.terminate()", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">Enumerations</a></li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": false, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "api/enums/index", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": true, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}